    >[x] Implement and test the pure three-way action-list merge together =semantic-merge-core $Paired with Darrion, one reviewed test at a time. Match by UUID and reconcile each field against base: if one side equals base take the other, else report a conflict. Done when tests cover neighbouring edits, same-field conflicts, delete versus edit, add versus complete, reparent and reorder, with nothing lost or duplicated.$ !1 +human ^2026-11-09T06:02 %2026-11-25T23:17 <semantic-merge-first-test #01a1bee6-6faf-79f0-9d39-2eac0eefa969
